{"data":{"title":"A Lie","slug":"a-lie","path":"/artists/kelela/tracks/a-lie/","artwork":"images/artists/kelela/tracks/a-lie.jpg","artist":{"id":"oaOvBYTFX0s","slug":"kelela","links":null,"title":"Kelela","artwork":null},"id":"pLmpGNgAZX4"},"appearanceCount":6,"markers":[{"chapter":{"id":"Fsi2QVxTuBc","show":{"id":"p1pSbRuL7vA","slug":"timeless-sounds-10-year-mix","title":"Timeless Sounds 10 Year Mix","artwork":"images/episodes/timeless-sounds-10-year-mix/timeless-sounds-10-year-mix.jpg","content":"\n9 mixes from our heavy hitters. \nSounds from all over the world\n\n<!--more-->\n\nAired exclusively on Apple Music.\n\nJump to: \n\n- [Joe Kay](#joe-kay)\n- [Shaka Lion](#shaka-lion)\n- [JAEL](#jael)\n- [Andre Power](#andre-power)\n- [KRONIKA](#kronika)\n- [ESTA.](#esta)\n- [Sasha Marie](#sasha-marie)\n- [IAMNOBODI](#iamnobodi)\n- [Jared Jackson](#jared-jackson)","published_at":"2021-04-10T16:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"Mvoau03ZDYI","show":{"id":"RZtsdfDAG2Q","slug":"181","title":"Soulection Radio Show #181 w/ Chris McClenney & The Whooligan","artwork":"/images/episodes/181.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","published_at":"2014-07-26T01:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"BHPMqaG-PZA","show":{"id":"tG9uuDVmGUg","slug":"187","title":"Soulection Radio Show #187 w/ Sango","artwork":"/images/episodes/187.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","published_at":"2014-10-04T18:00:09+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"UQKUtJsffKA","show":{"id":"cdnqQ9xehXc","slug":"195","title":"Soulection Radio Show #195","artwork":"/images/episodes/195.jpg","content":"Joe Kay continues the freestyle of all music. \n\n<!--more-->\nLast week's show was definitely one of my favorites to date. It's weird how things work. It's the shows that I feel most unprepared for that end up doing well... maybe it's because I just really freestyle and go off of my whole library of music rather than trying to curate a specific vibe. It was hard to top last week's show but I did my best to really take it right back to the early beat era from 2008-2012 and played some current gems as well. I hope you enjoy this. I'll be back next week with a guest maybe.\n\nBless.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","published_at":"2014-11-29T00:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"5WH6cSQm17Y","show":{"id":"u-NFsPmvKqA","slug":"278","title":"Soulection Radio Show #278 (Live from London, UK)","artwork":"/images/episodes/278.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","published_at":"2016-09-24T00:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"LKAx6iO4q1Y","show":{"id":"hAi9mwV9eBQ","slug":"338","title":"Soulection Radio Show #338","artwork":"/images/episodes/338.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","published_at":"2017-12-02T00:00:00+00:00"}}}],"linkedPlatforms":[{"id":78723,"platform":"amazonMusic","href":"https://www.amazon.co.uk/A-Lie-Prod-Bok/dp/B00UGT9V9G?tag=soulectiontracklists-21","artwork":null,"last_checked_at":"2021-04-17T10:33:55.382+00:00","track":"pLmpGNgAZX4"},{"id":59132,"platform":"youtube","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6kMFyrDSYzI","artwork":null,"last_checked_at":"2021-04-17T10:52:08+00:00","track":"pLmpGNgAZX4"},{"id":59111,"platform":"bandcamp","href":"https://kelelafade.bandcamp.com/track/a-lie-prod-bok-bok","artwork":"https://f4.bcbits.com/img/a0323821011_10.jpg","last_checked_at":"2021-04-17T10:52:08+00:00","track":"pLmpGNgAZX4"},{"id":59112,"platform":"tidal","href":"http://www.tidal.com/track/106697108","artwork":"https://resources.wimpmusic.com/images/eaeeb1eb/5af2/43b3/8be1/dd76e905c9f2/640x640.jpg","last_checked_at":"2021-04-17T10:52:08+00:00","track":"pLmpGNgAZX4"},{"id":59122,"platform":"soundcloud","href":"https://soundcloud.com/fadetomind/kelela-a-lie-prod-bok-bok","artwork":"https://i1.sndcdn.com/artworks-000059036140-iu7n